    {
      "id": "PMCGzAGIQMWGsoibNOAvf",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -509.832247823585,
      "y": 894.9786309753281,
      "width": 620,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b3s",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2043344381,
      "version": 220,
      "versionNonce": 494459773,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1771878104640,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "会对某件事进行强化，从坏的方向说：\n例如：\n如果别人直接让你做出巨大的让步，你是会拒绝对方的；\n但是通过强化一次一次让你做出微小让步，你渐渐就会做出很大的让步",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "会对某件事进行强化，从坏的方向说：\n例如：\n如果别人直接让你做出巨大的让步，你是会拒绝对方的；\n但是通过强化一次一次让你做出微小让步，你渐渐就会做出很大的让步",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
